---
import type { SiteLocale } from "@tgbox/shared";
import JsonLd from "@/components/layout/JsonLd.astro";
import { localizePath } from "@/i18n/locale.ts";
import { ui } from "@/i18n/ui.ts";
import { seoUi } from "@/i18n/ui-seo.ts";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { faqJsonLd } from "@/lib/json-ld.ts";
import { aboutSeo } from "@/lib/seo.ts";
import { botUrl, botUsername, licence, repoUrl, upstreamRepoUrl } from "@/lib/site.ts";

interface Props {
  locale: SiteLocale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale !== "en";
const bot = `@${botUsername}`;
const seo = aboutSeo(locale);
const { faq, faqHeading } = seoUi(locale);
const jsonLd = [faqJsonLd(faq)];
---

<PageLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={ui(locale).page.about}
  metaTitle={seo.title}
  metaDescription={seo.description}
  keywords={seo.keywords}
  eyebrow="About"
  updated="2026-11-15"
  description={zh
      ? "TGsearch 按主题整理公开的 Telegram 频道、群组和机器人，提供简体中文、繁体中文和英文浏览入口。这里说明资料来源、收录方式和反馈渠道。"
      : "TGsearch organizes public Telegram channels, groups and bots by topic, with browsing in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English. Learn where entry information comes from and how to submit or correct it."}
>
  <JsonLd slot="head" data={jsonLd} />
  {zh ? (
      <>
        <p>找 Telegram 资源时，先确定主题，再了解条目的实际用途。TGsearch 把分类、标签、公开简介和可获取的数据放在一起，帮助你建立候选清单，并通过详情页前往 Telegram 查看原始内容。</p>
        <h2>怎样使用目录</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>从<a href={localizePath("/channel/", locale)}>频道</a>、<a href={localizePath("/group/", locale)}>群组</a>或<a href={localizePath("/bot/", locale)}>机器人</a>入口选择类型，再按分类和标签浏览。</li>
          <li>在详情页核对用户名、简介和语言。频道还可查看最近消息与活跃度，具体以公开资料可获取的字段为准。</li>
          <li>结合<a href={localizePath("/rank/", locale)}>排行榜</a>与成员趋势了解变化，阅读图表时留意采样日期和数据缺口。</li>
          <li>通过条目入口打开 Telegram，进一步确认功能、内容来源和使用条件。</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>资料来源与更新</h2>
        <p>名称、简介、头像和可获取的成员数据来自 Telegram 公开页面。系统定时刷新资料，网站通过构建发布更新。条目可能缺少创建时间、历史趋势或消息预览，本站与 Telegram 当前页面也可能存在时间差。简介的自动译文会作标记，用户名、链接和重要条件可继续与原始页面核对。</p>
        <p>条目的失效状态经过重复检测确认后处理。遇到错误分类、失效链接或资料不符，可以通过本页反馈渠道提供具体条目，帮助维护目录。</p>
        <h2>收录与推广</h2>
        <p>普通收录免费。打开<a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>提交收录说明</a>，使用本站机器人提交公开链接并确认资料，审核结果通过私信通知。审核通过的条目随网站构建发布。</p>
        <p>付费或合作展示带有“推广”标记。选择条目时，请结合实际内容、公开资料和使用条件作判断。浏览目录无需注册本站账号，相关数据处理说明见<a href={localizePath("/privacy-policy/", locale)}>隐私政策</a>。</p>
        <h2>关于本项目</h2>
        <p>TGsearch 基于 tgbox 开源项目维护，站点、收录机器人和管理后台代码位于<a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">TGsearch 源码仓库</a>，以 <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> 许可证发布。你可以在本站仓库提交问题或改进建议。原始项目与来源署名见<a href={upstreamRepoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">tgbox 上游仓库</a>。</p>
        <h2>联系我们</h2>
        <p>需要更正资料、举报内容或申请删除条目时，打开<a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">本站收录机器人 {bot}</a>，发送 <code>/support</code>，按提示提供条目用户名、本站链接和具体原因。发送 <code>/help</code> 可查看提交说明。</p>
        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (<><h3>{item.question}</h3><p>{item.answer}</p></>))}
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p>Start with a topic, then check what each Telegram resource offers. TGsearch brings categories, tags, public descriptions and available data together so you can build a shortlist and open the original content from an entry page.</p>
        <h2>Using the directory</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Choose <a href={localizePath("/channel/", locale)}>channels</a>, <a href={localizePath("/group/", locale)}>groups</a> or <a href={localizePath("/bot/", locale)}>bots</a>, then browse their categories and tags.</li>
          <li>Check usernames, descriptions and languages on entry pages. Channels may also show recent posts and activity, depending on the public information available.</li>
          <li>Use <a href={localizePath("/rank/", locale)}>rankings</a> and member history to explore changes. Review sampling dates and gaps when reading charts.</li>
          <li>Open the entry in Telegram to confirm its purpose, content sources and usage conditions.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Sources and updates</h2>
        <p>Names, descriptions, avatars and available member data come from public Telegram pages. Scheduled tasks refresh the information, and site builds publish updates. Creation dates, history or post previews may be missing, and directory information can lag behind Telegram. Automatic translations are labelled. Check usernames, links and important conditions against the original page.</p>
        <p>Repeated checks confirm unavailable entries before their status is handled. Send the entry details through our feedback channel if you find an incorrect category, a broken link or information that needs correction.</p>
        <h2>Listings and promotion</h2>
        <p>Regular listing is free. Open the <a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>submission guide</a>, use this site's bot to submit a public link and confirm the fetched details. Review results arrive by private message, and approved entries are published with a site build.</p>
        <p>Paid or partner placements carry a “Promoted” label. Review the content, public information and usage conditions when choosing an entry. Browsing requires no site account. See the <a href={localizePath("/privacy-policy/", locale)}>privacy policy</a> for information about data processing.</p>
        <h2>About this project</h2>
        <p>TGsearch is based on tgbox. The website, submission bot and admin code are maintained in the <a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">TGsearch source repository</a> under the <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> licence. Submit issues and improvements to this site's repository. The original project is credited in the <a href={upstreamRepoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">tgbox upstream repository</a>.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For corrections, content reports or removal requests, open <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">our submission bot {bot}</a> and send <code>/support</code>. Follow the prompts and provide the username, directory URL and reason. Use <code>/help</code> to read the submission instructions.</p>
        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (<><h3>{item.question}</h3><p>{item.answer}</p></>))}
      </>
    )}
</PageLayout>
